<title>GERMANY: Cass Ex-Germany July Europe, Africa, M.East data.</title>
<headline>Cass Ex-Germany July Europe, Africa, M.East data.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table shows IATA Cargo Accounts Settlement System (CASS) statistics for the ex-Germany air cargo market in July 1996.</p>
<p>			 Germany     Europe	Africa	M. East</p>
<p> Weight (kg)	 651,140   4,509,257   2,061,236   3,966,862</p>
<p> Kg change (6/96)     3.4%	  2.2%	-2.0%	  0.6%</p>
<p> Kg change (7/95)     4.4%	  5.5%     -16.3%	 10.4%</p>
<p> Dm change (6/96)     4.3%	  2.0%	-1.5%	 -0.8%</p>
<p> Dm change (7/95)    -2.7%	  4.2%     -24.8%	  6.4%</p>
<p> Dm/Kg change (6/96)  0.8%	 -0.2%	 0.6%	 -1.5%</p>
<p>-- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
